{"_v":1,"id":"jesus-christ-superstar-west-end-2026","cat":"west-end","cs":68.21,"rc":10,"bd":{"positive":4,"mixed":5,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/news/jesus-christ-superstar-palladium-2026-070726","d":"2026-07-07","q":"All in all it's a good production that slots into the Jamie Lloyd era of Sexy Lloyd Webber very nicely indeed. The problem, I'm afraid, is the lead."},{"cn":"Dominic Maxwell","o":"The Times (UK)","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/jesus-christ-superstar-review-sam-ryder-london-palladium-tim-sheader-zfqtxmj8b","d":"2026-07-04"},{"cn":"Rachel Halliburton","o":"The Times (UK)","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/jesus-christ-superstar-review-sam-ryder-london-palladium-tim-sheader-zfqtxmj8b","d":"2026-07-04"},{"cn":"Stuart King","o":"London Box Office","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/jesus-christ-superstar-london-palladium-review","d":"2026-07-08","q":"In all, a terrific effort, albeit once again over amplified."},{"cn":"Greg Stewart","o":"Theatre Weekly","s":58,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://theatreweekly.com/review-jesus-christ-superstar-at-the-london-palladium/","d":"2026-07-07","q":"Ultimately, this Jesus Christ Superstar is a slick and visually striking revival that too often mistakes scale for substance."},{"cn":"London Palladium","o":"London Theatre","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatrereviews.co.uk/post.cfm?p=28304","d":"2026-07-07","q":"It is an evening that feels more like an uneven, slightly muted concert than a fully realised, transcendent piece of musical theatre."},{"cn":"Olivia Garrett","o":"Radio Times","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.radiotimes.com/going-out/going-out-reviews/jesus-christ-superstar-review/","d":"2026-07-08","q":"Go see it instantly and then go see it again."},{"cn":"Louise Penn","o":"Cambridge","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://loureviews.blog/2026/07/08/sam-ryder-and-jesus-christ-superstar/","d":"2026-07-07","q":"This production is easily five-star. It is well-designed, scored and presented."},{"cn":"Stephanie Osztreicher","o":"West End Best Friend","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.westendbestfriend.co.uk/news/review-jesus-christ-superstar-london-palladium","d":"2026-07-08","q":"This production does not radically reinterpret Jesus Christ Superstar. Instead, it reminds us why the work has endured for over fifty years."},{"cn":"All That Dazzles","o":"All That Dazzles  (UK)","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://www.allthatdazzles.co.uk/post/review-jesus-christ-superstar-london-palladium","d":"2026-07-07","q":"Though it isn't anywhere near so bad that you could say the show has been crucified, it's fair to say this version of Jesus Christ Superstar doesn't quite manage to exceed expectations."}],"au":{"score":87.03,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"lb":{"s":96,"c":20,"sr":4.8},"mz":{"s":85,"c":341,"sr":4.3},"sp":{"s":89,"c":115,"sr":4.47},"ss":{"s":91,"c":72},"rd":{"s":93,"c":22,"tp":13,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0.55,"positive":0.27,"mixed":0.09,"negative":0.05,"neutral":0.05}}}},"sh":{"wk":"20260831","days":[{"m":null,"e":"19:30"},{"m":null,"e":"19:30"},{"m":null,"e":"19:30"},{"m":"14:30","e":"19:30"},{"m":null,"e":"19:30"},{"m":"14:30","e":"19:30"},{"m":null,"e":null}]},"pd":"2026-06-20"}